# Description: On-demand todo_md task management rules and role/task workflow prompts
rule vitalio/todo_md:todo_md
[if role=design]
    [if task=] $ todo_md
    [if task!=] $ todo_md {task:}
    prompt Mode: DESIGN. Explore requirements and architecture; once agreed, update AGENTS.md and .agents_bundle as needed, and record the design specification in TODO.md via todo_md.
[/if]
[if role=plan]
    [if task=] $ todo_md
    [if task!=] $ todo_md {task:}
    prompt Mode: PLANNING. Decompose work into flat, self-contained tasks in TODO.md (default status NEW), record target repository file paths in backticks in each task body, and promote ready prioritized tasks via todo_md next <ID>; once task <ID> is agreed, initialize a new session bundle via todo_md <ID> | agents_bundle role=execute | run_block (or agents_bundle role=execute task=<ID> | run_block).
[/if]
[if role=execute]
    var task=$(todo_md next-id)
    [if task=]
        $ todo_md
        prompt Mode: EXECUTION. No active [WIP] or [NEXT] task found in TODO.md; ask the user which task to execute.
    [/if]
    [if task!=]
        $ todo_md status {task:} WIP
        $ todo_md {task:}
        include $(todo_md files {task:})
        prompt Mode: EXECUTION (task={task:}). If all target files for task {task:} are already preloaded in this bundle, proceed directly to edit, test, and diff in step 1; otherwise inspect any missing target files in one batched step first, deliver verified code and commits, and mark the task done via todo_md done {task:} before the final commit so task completion is committed atomically with code changes.
    [/if]
[/if]
[if role=audit]
    $ todo_md
    prompt Mode: AUDIT. Audit the requested scope against active rules (checking TODO.md to avoid duplicates), report findings in chat, and after user agreement record remediation tasks in TODO.md via todo_md add.
[/if]
